    [*] --> exited : provider killed
    exited --> ownerEnds : watch sees pid gone
    exited --> refused : up or down meets it
    refused --> recover : status process-exited
    recover --> stopped : runtime recover
    ownerEnds --> stopped : owner exits
    stopped --> resumed : run recovered as after a stop
    resumed --> [*]

    note right of recover
